# Physical mods - obsidian (actions/obsidian/obsidian_physical_mods.kbd)
**lctl + b**         -- Page Up
**lctl + f**         -- Page Down
**lctl + t**         -- Tabs New
**lctl + ,**         -- Setting
**lctl + ;**         -- Vimola
**lctl + [**         -- Omni [
**lctl + ]**         -- Omni ]
**lctl + lsft + t**  -- Tabs Undo Close
**!lctl + a**        -- Select All Text
**!lctl + b**        -- Bold Text
**!lctl + e**        -- Toggle Edit Mode
**!lctl + p**        -- Select Files
**!lctl + r**        -- Toggle Source Mode
**!lctl + ,**        -- Setting
**!lctl + lsft + p** -- Commands
**lalt + tab**       -- Windows Walk Through Same App
